# 完了条件\n\n```text\n1. foldLines(\"the quick brown fox\", 10) は \"the quick\\nbrown fox\" を返す（空白の位置で折り返し、行の区切りは \\n）\n2. foldLines(\"a b c\", 1) は \"a\\nb\\nc\" を返す\n3. foldLines(\"abcdefghij\", 4) は \"abcd\\nefgh\\nij\" を返す（width より長い語は width ごとに切る）\n4. foldLines(\"a   b\", 10) は \"a b\" を返す（続く空白は1つにまとめる）\n5. foldLines(\"  a  \", 10) は \"a\" を返す（前後の空白は除く）\n6. foldLines(\"\", 5) は \"\" を返す\n7. width が 1 より小さいか整数でないとき（0、-1、1.5、NaN）は RangeError を投げる\n8. 新しいテストのファイルに node:test のテストがあり、npm test で既存のテストも含めて全部通る\n```\n\n### 今回やらないこと\n\n```text\n- 既存の関数の変更、既存のテストのファイルの変更、全角文字の幅の扱い、s が文字列以外のときの扱い\n```\n\n<!-- merge-while-you-sleep:eyJraW5kIjoiYXBwcm92YWwiLCJydW5faWQiOiI0NDAxOTg0NDExNCIsImhhc2giOiI1NTMxOTA3ZTg5OTFkNmE1M2M1NGYxODk5MmEyMjAyZDU1ZWJiYTAwNjE1YmQ5NGY2OTVkNWMyNTBhYzg3ZWQwIn0= -->","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shumatsumonobu/merge-while-you-sleep-trial/issues/comments/6938717152/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":15368,"client_id":"Iv1.05c79e9ad1f6bdfa","slug":"github-actions","node_id":"MDM6QXBwMTUzNjg=","owner":{"login":"github","id":9919,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjk5MTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9919?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github","html_url":"https://github.com/github","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.